{% comment %}
  =====================================================
  FAMBOX Subscription Plan Card — Section v0.2 (Phase 1)
  =====================================================
  Spec: brand/fambox/design-system/components/subscription-plan-card.md
  Spec date: 2026-04-27 (§13 v0.3 で 10→8 項目縮小)
  Figma: Component Set 65:110 (standard / featured 2 variants)
  既存実装: fambox-subscription-plan.liquid (506 行、v0.1 系) と並行配置
  Implementation date: 2026-05-12

  Card Pattern 継承:
    - card-standard (通常プラン)
    - card-featured (推奨プラン、Drive 2px 枠 + 「おすすめ」バッジ)

  8 項目構成 (spec §13 v0.3):
    1. プラン名 (h3)
    2. 価格 (h2 32px Ink、Drive 色は煽り違反のため不使用)
    3. 提供頻度 (価格隣、月1回 / 週2回 等)
    4. 1回あたりの食数 (例: 7食 × 4回 = 28食/月)
    5. カスタマイズ可否 (○ △ ×)
    6. 推奨対象 (ジュニア / 大学生 / プロ)
    7. 特典・サポート (✓ チェックリスト)
    8. CTA × 2 (Primary + Ghost)

  Anti (Spec §13 で確定):
    - 最低契約期間 → FAQ / 規約 / 問合せで扱う、カード内非表示
    - 初月特典 → キャンペーン施策側で扱う
    - 価格 Drive 64px → 煽り Anti
    - 全プランに「おすすめ」バッジ → 強調消失 Anti

  Phase 1 範囲:
    - 1 section で複数プラン (blocks) 並列表示
    - 各 block: variant (standard / featured) + 8 項目
    - Featured は section 全体で 1 個まで (人間運用、Lint 未実装)
    - CTA 2 個構成 (Primary + Ghost)
    - Responsive: PC 3 列 / Tablet 2 列 / SP 1 列

  v0.3 候補:
    - Featured が 2 個以上配置された場合の Lint 警告
    - 価格比較ボタン (複数プラン横並びでの差分ハイライト)
    - 推奨対象に応じた条件分岐表示
=====================================================
{% endcomment %}

<section class="plans plans-{{ section.settings.layout }}" data-gtag-section="subscription_plans">
  <div class="plans__inner">

    {%- if section.settings.title != blank or section.settings.intro != blank -%}
      <header class="plans__header">
        {%- if section.settings.title != blank -%}
          <h2 class="plans__title">{{ section.settings.title }}</h2>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if section.settings.intro != blank -%}
          <p class="plans__intro">{{ section.settings.intro }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
      </header>
    {%- endif -%}

    <div class="plans__grid">
      {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
        {%- if block.type == 'plan' -%}
          {%- liquid
            assign variant_class = 'card-standard'
            if block.settings.is_featured
              assign variant_class = 'card-featured'
            endif
          -%}

          <article class="card {{ variant_class }} plan-card"
                   {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
                   {% if block.settings.is_featured %}aria-label="おすすめプラン"{% endif %}>

            {%- if block.settings.is_featured -%}
              <span class="plan-card__badge">おすすめ</span>
            {%- endif -%}

            {%- comment -%} 1. プラン名 {%- endcomment -%}
            <h3 class="plan-card__name">{{ block.settings.plan_name }}</h3>

            {%- comment -%} 2-3. 価格 + 頻度 {%- endcomment -%}
            <div class="plan-card__price-row">
              <span class="plan-card__price">{{ block.settings.price }}</span>
              {%- if block.settings.frequency != blank -%}
                <span class="plan-card__price-unit">{{ block.settings.frequency }}</span>
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>

            <hr class="plan-card__divider" aria-hidden="true">

            {%- comment -%} 4-6. メタ情報 (食数 / カスタマイズ / 推奨対象) {%- endcomment -%}
            <dl class="plan-card__meta">
              {%- if block.settings.meals != blank -%}
                <div class="plan-card__meta-row">
                  <dt>食数</dt>
                  <dd>{{ block.settings.meals }}</dd>
                </div>
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- if block.settings.customizable != blank -%}
                <div class="plan-card__meta-row">
                  <dt>カスタマイズ</dt>
                  <dd>{{ block.settings.customizable }}</dd>
                </div>
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- if block.settings.target != blank -%}
                <div class="plan-card__meta-row">
                  <dt>推奨対象</dt>
                  <dd>{{ block.settings.target }}</dd>
                </div>
              {%- endif -%}
            </dl>

            <hr class="plan-card__divider" aria-hidden="true">

            {%- comment -%} 7. 特典・サポート {%- endcomment -%}
            {%- if block.settings.features != blank -%}
              <div class="plan-card__features-area">
                {%- if block.settings.features_heading != blank -%}
                  <p class="plan-card__features-heading">{{ block.settings.features_heading }}</p>
                {%- endif -%}
                <ul class="plan-card__features" role="list">
                  {%- assign features_lines = block.settings.features | newline_to_br | split: '<br />' -%}
                  {%- for line in features_lines -%}
                    {%- assign trimmed = line | strip -%}
                    {%- if trimmed != blank -%}
                      <li class="plan-card__feature">
                        <span class="plan-card__feature-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
                        <span>{{ trimmed }}</span>
                      </li>
                    {%- endif -%}
                  {%- endfor -%}
                </ul>
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}

            {%- comment -%} 8. CTA × 2 {%- endcomment -%}
            <div class="plan-card__actions">
              {%- if block.settings.cta_primary_label != blank -%}
                <a href="{{ block.settings.cta_primary_url }}"
                   class="btn btn-primary btn-lg"
                   data-gtag-cta="plan_primary_{{ block.settings.plan_name | handleize }}">
                  {{ block.settings.cta_primary_label }}
                </a>
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- if block.settings.cta_secondary_label != blank -%}
                <a href="{{ block.settings.cta_secondary_url }}"
                   class="btn btn-ghost"
                   data-gtag-cta="plan_secondary_{{ block.settings.plan_name | handleize }}">
                  {{ block.settings.cta_secondary_label }}
                </a>
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>

          </article>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>

    {%- if section.settings.disclaimer != blank -%}
      <p class="plans__disclaimer">{{ section.settings.disclaimer }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* === Section base === */
  .plans {
    width: 100%;
    padding-block: var(--space-7, 64px);
    background: var(--bg-secondary, #fafafa);
  }
  .plans__inner {
    max-width: var(--container-max, 1440px);
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-inline: var(--space-3, 24px);
  }

  /* === Header === */
  .plans__header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6, 48px);
  }
  .plans__title {
    font-family: var(--font-ja, 'Hiragino Sans', sans-serif);
    font-size: var(--fs-h2, 32px);
    font-weight: var(--fw-bold, 700);
    color: var(--color-ink, #1b1d1a);
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-2, 16px);
  }
  .plans__intro {
    font-family: var(--font-ja, 'Hiragino Sans', sans-serif);
    font-size: var(--fs-body, 16px);
    color: var(--color-sub, #545655);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* === Grid: PC 3 列 / Tablet 2 列 / SP 1 列 === */
  .plans__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-4, 32px);
    align-items: stretch;
  }
  @media (max-width: 1023px) {
    .plans__grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: var(--space-3, 24px); }
  }
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .plans__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: var(--space-3, 24px); }
  }

  /* === Card Pattern 継承 (card.md v0.2 準拠) === */
  .card {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2, 16px);
    background: var(--bg-primary, #ffffff);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light, #ececec);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md, 8px);
    padding: var(--space-3, 24px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-1, 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.04));
    transition: box-shadow var(--duration-base, 0.3s) var(--ease-out),
                transform var(--duration-base, 0.3s) var(--ease-out);
  }
  .card:hover {
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-3, 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.08));
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
  .card-featured {
    border: 2px solid var(--color-drive, #fb4c15);
    padding: calc(var(--space-3, 24px) - 1px);
  }

  /* === Plan-specific === */
  .plan-card__badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: -12px;
    right: var(--space-3, 24px);
    padding: var(--space-1, 8px) var(--space-2, 16px);
    background: var(--color-drive, #fb4c15);
    color: var(--color-white, #ffffff);
    font-family: var(--font-ja, 'Hiragino Sans', sans-serif);
    font-size: var(--fs-caption, 12px);
    font-weight: var(--fw-semibold, 600);
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill, 9999px);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
  .plan-card__name {
    font-family: var(--font-ja, 'Hiragino Sans', sans-serif);
    font-size: var(--fs-h3, 24px);
    font-weight: var(--fw-bold, 700);
    color: var(--color-ink, #1b1d1a);
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* 価格行: Spec §13 Q2 確定 — 32px Ink, Drive 不使用 */
  .plan-card__price-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: var(--space-1, 8px);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .plan-card__price {
    font-family: var(--font-en, 'Poppins', sans-serif);
    font-size: var(--fs-h2, 32px);
    font-weight: var(--fw-bold, 700);
    color: var(--color-ink, #1b1d1a);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: var(--ls-en, 0);
  }
  .plan-card__price-unit {
    font-family: var(--font-ja, 'Hiragino Sans', sans-serif);
    font-size: var(--fs-body, 16px);
    font-weight: var(--fw-regular, 400);
    color: var(--color-sub, #545655);
  }

  .plan-card__divider {
    width: 100%;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--border-light, #ececec);
    border: 0;
    margin: var(--space-2, 16px) 0;
  }

  /* メタ情報 (definition list) */
  .plan-card__meta {
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-1, 8px);
  }
  .plan-card__meta-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 6em 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-2, 16px);
    font-family: var(--font-ja, 'Hiragino Sans', sans-serif);
    font-size: var(--fs-body-sm, 14px);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .plan-card__meta-row dt {
    color: var(--color-sub, #545655);
    font-weight: var(--fw-medium, 500);
  }
  .plan-card__meta-row dd {
    color: var(--color-ink, #1b1d1a);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Features (✓ チェックリスト) */
  .plan-card__features-area {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2, 16px);
  }
  .plan-card__features-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-ja, 'Hiragino Sans', sans-serif);
    font-size: var(--fs-body-sm, 14px);
    font-weight: var(--fw-semibold, 600);
    color: var(--color-ink, #1b1d1a);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .plan-card__features {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-1, 8px);
  }
  .plan-card__feature {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-1, 8px);
    align-items: flex-start;
    font-family: var(--font-ja, 'Hiragino Sans', sans-serif);
    font-size: var(--fs-body-sm, 14px);
    color: var(--color-ink, #1b1d1a);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .plan-card__feature-check {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    color: var(--color-drive, #fb4c15);
    font-weight: var(--fw-bold, 700);
  }

  /* Actions: Spec §13 Q3 確定 — Primary + Ghost 縦並び */
  .plan-card__actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2, 16px);
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: var(--space-3, 24px);
  }
  .plan-card__actions .btn { width: 100%; text-align: center; justify-content: center; }

  /* Disclaimer */
  .plans__disclaimer {
    margin-top: var(--space-5, 32px);
    text-align: center;
    font-family: var(--font-ja, 'Hiragino Sans', sans-serif);
    font-size: var(--fs-caption, 12px);
    color: var(--color-caption, #888888);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* === reduced motion === */
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .card { transition: none; }
    .card:hover { transform: none; }
  }
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "FAMBOX Subscription Plans",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section-plans",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "セクション全体"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "layout",
      "label": "レイアウト",
      "default": "standard",
      "options": [
        { "value": "standard", "label": "Standard (3 列 / Tablet 2 / SP 1) ★既定" },
        { "value": "compact",  "label": "Compact (2 列固定)" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "title",
      "label": "見出し",
      "default": "あなたのチームに合うプランを"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "intro",
      "label": "リード文"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "disclaimer",
      "label": "注釈 (税表記等)",
      "default": "※価格はすべて税込です。最低契約期間・キャンペーン特典については [FAQ](/pages/faq) をご覧ください。"
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "plan",
      "name": "プラン",
      "limit": 6,
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "checkbox",
          "id": "is_featured",
          "label": "おすすめプラン (Featured)",
          "default": false,
          "info": "DNA: section 内で 1 プランのみ true にする"
        },
        {
          "type": "header",
          "content": "1-3. プラン名 / 価格 / 頻度"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "plan_name",
          "label": "プラン名",
          "default": "Pro Athlete Plan"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "price",
          "label": "価格 (税込)",
          "default": "¥48,000"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "frequency",
          "label": "提供頻度 (例: 「/ 月」「月1回」)",
          "default": "/ 月"
        },
        {
          "type": "header",
          "content": "4-6. メタ情報"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "meals",
          "label": "食数",
          "default": "7食 × 4回 = 28食/月"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "customizable",
          "label": "カスタマイズ可否",
          "default": "○ 個別対応可"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "target",
          "label": "推奨対象",
          "default": "プロ・実業団"
        },
        {
          "type": "header",
          "content": "7. 特典・サポート"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "features_heading",
          "label": "リスト見出し",
          "default": "含まれるもの"
        },
        {
          "type": "textarea",
          "id": "features",
          "label": "特典 (1 行 1 項目)",
          "default": "個別栄養設計\n月1回の栄養相談\n配送時の体調ヒアリング"
        },
        {
          "type": "header",
          "content": "8. CTA × 2"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "cta_primary_label",
          "label": "Primary CTA ラベル",
          "default": "このプランで始めてみる"
        },
        {
          "type": "url",
          "id": "cta_primary_url",
          "label": "Primary CTA リンク先"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "cta_secondary_label",
          "label": "Secondary CTA ラベル",
          "default": "話を聞いてみる"
        },
        {
          "type": "url",
          "id": "cta_secondary_url",
          "label": "Secondary CTA リンク先",
          "default": "/contact"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "FAMBOX Subscription Plans",
      "category": "Plans",
      "blocks": [
        { "type": "plan" },
        { "type": "plan", "settings": { "is_featured": true, "plan_name": "Pro Athlete Plan" } },
        { "type": "plan" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
